# Implementation Plan - Opening Balances (الارصدة الافتتاحيه)

The goal is to refactor the "Opening Balances" feature to use the dedicated `opening_entries` and `opening_entry_lines` tables, ensuring proper separation of concerns and linking to the General Ledger (`journal_entries`) upon posting.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> I will be switching the storage from `journal_entries` to `opening_entries`. Existing opening balances stored as journal entries might not be visible in the new Opening Balance list unless migrated (migration is out of scope unless requested).
> Posting an Opening Balance will now create a corresponding Journal Entry.

## Proposed Changes

### Data Layer
#### [MODIFY] [opening_balance_model.dart](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/data/models/opening_balance_model.dart)
- Update `fromMap`/[toMap](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/data/models/opening_balance_model.dart#42-59) to match `opening_entries` table columns:
    - `entry_date` -> [date](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/presentation/cubit/opening_balance_cubit.dart#141-168)
    - `description` -> `statement`
    - `total_debit` -> `debit_amount`
    - `total_credit` -> `credit_amount`
- Update [OpeningBalanceLineModel](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/data/models/opening_balance_model.dart#101-176):
    - Map `debit`/`credit` to `amount` and `type` (1=Debit, 2=Credit) for `opening_entry_lines` table.

#### [MODIFY] [opening_balance_local_datasource.dart](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/data/datasources/opening_balance_local_datasource.dart)
- Change table references from `journal_entries` to `opening_entries`.
- Change line table references from `journal_entry_lines` to `opening_entry_lines`.
- **Refactor [postOpeningBalance](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/data/datasources/opening_balance_local_datasource.dart#183-216)**:
    - Mark `opening_entry` as posted.
    - **Create a new Journal Entry** in `journal_entries` table to reflect this transaction in the General Ledger.
    - Update Account Balances.

### Domain Layer
- [OpeningBalanceEntity](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/domain/entities/opening_balance_entity.dart#3-96) remains largely unchanged, serving as the abstraction.

### Presentation Layer
#### [MODIFY] [opening_balance_cubit.dart](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/presentation/cubit/opening_balance_cubit.dart)
- Ensure it handles the updated model/datasource correctly.
- Verify [saveOpeningBalance](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/presentation/cubit/opening_balance_cubit.dart#227-251) and [postOpeningBalance](file:///d:/Flutter/projects/muhasib/lib/features/accounts/data/datasources/opening_balance_local_datasource.dart#183-216) flows.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1.  **Create Opening Balance**:
    - Add lines (Debit/Credit).
    - Save.
    - Verify it is saved in `opening_entries` table (using DB inspector or by listing).
2.  **Post Opening Balance**:
    - Click Post.
    - Verify `status` becomes Posted.
    - **Verify a new Journal Entry is created** in `journal_entries` table with the same details.
    - Verify Account Balances are updated.
3.  **Edit/Delete**:
    - Verify Edit works (before posting).
    - Verify Delete works (before posting).
